    Check copyright namerecords match license file.
    with SABModulCode-Italic.ttf

    Rationale:                                                                
                                                                                
    A known licensing description must be provided in the NameID 14 (LICENSE    
    DESCRIPTION) entries of the name table.                                     
                                                                                
    The source of truth for this check (to determine which license is in use)   
    is a file placed side-by-side to your font project including the licensing  
    terms.                                                                      
                                                                                
    Depending on the chosen license, one of the following string snippets is    
    expected to be found on the NameID 13 (LICENSE DESCRIPTION) entries of the  
    name table:                                                                 
                                                                                
    - "This Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version  
    1.1. This license is available with a FAQ at: openfontlicense.org"          
                                                                                
    - "Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0"                          
                                                                                
    - "Licensed under the Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0."                             
                                                                                
    Currently accepted licenses are Apache or Open Font License. For a small    
    set of legacy families the Ubuntu Font License may be acceptable as well.   
                                                                                
    When in doubt, please choose OFL for new font projects.                     
                                                                                
    More info: https://github.com/fonttools/fontbakery/issues/4829

